---
kind: lore
id: isolation
title: The isolation wing
components: [../components/soothe.component.lute]
---

<beat use="soothe" id="edith" who="edith" bed="bedFour" instance="use-001">
  @edith{code="0010"}: Is it three yet, Sister? He said he'd come at three.
  @nell{code="0010"}: Not yet. Go to sleep, Edith.
</beat>

<beat use="soothe" id="walter" who="walter" bed="pellChair" tune="You wind the music box and set it on the arm of his chair." when="holds('holding', ['musicBox'])" instance="use-002">
  @walter{code="0010"}: My wife had one of those. She played it on visiting days.
</beat>

<beat use="soothe" id="june" who="june" bed="juneCot" when="entry.fileJune.read" instance="use-003">
  @june{code="0010"}: You know my name. Nobody here knows my name.
</beat>

<beat id="breathing" on="lightsFlicker" for="kind:patient" once="false" after="visited('room.isolation')" when="holds('restless', [occasion.target])">
  @narrator{code="0010"}: In the dark, {{occasion.target}} is sitting up in bed.
  /* the family is written member by member: one ::set per patient */
  <match subject="occasion.target">
    <when is="edith">
      ::set{run.unrest.edith += 1}
    </when>
    <when is="walter">
      ::set{run.unrest.walter += 1}
    </when>
    <when is="june">
      ::set{run.unrest.june += 1}
    </when>
  </match>
  @narrator{code="0020" when="run.unrest[occasion.target] >= 2"}: Closer to the edge of the bed than last time.
</beat>

<beat id="dark" on="lightsFlicker" priority="10" once="false" after="visited('room.isolation')">
  ::vfx{type="flicker"}
  @narrator{code="0010"}: The bulbs tick and die. {{occasion.payload.seconds:plural(One second|# seconds)}} of dark.
</beat>

<beat id="back" on="lightsFlicker" priority="-10" once="false" after="visited('room.isolation')">
  <match subject="run.hush">
    <when is="3..">
      @narrator{code="0010"}: The lights come back on three quiet beds.
    </when>
    <otherwise>
      @narrator{code="0020"}: The lights come back. {{run.hush:plural(One bed is|# beds are)}} quiet.
    </otherwise>
  </match>
</beat>

<entry id="flickerHour" on="lightsFlicker" once="slot" when="@lateNight">
  @nell{code="0010" mono}: The boiler can't hold it. Every hour it's worse.
</entry>

<beat id="wingHour" on="hourStrikes" once="false" after="visited('room.isolation')" when="!@wingQuiet">
  @edith{code="0010" os}: Sister? Is that three?
</beat>

<beat id="tobyBelow" on="enter" target="room.isolation" also once="run" when="@withToby">
  @tobias{code="0010"}: I've been here. I've been down here before. Nell, I've been in that cot.
</beat>
